            "review_title": "Review at Cow Express",
            "review_text": "Noah\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam65 contributions\n0\nInfinity friendship combo\nOct 2023 • Friends\nI've been coming here since 2014, after so many years they still maintain the same good quality as before. In particular, all types of pasta here are irresistible, the best one to try is Lasagne. \nToday, I used the friendship combo because they are having a discount offer for groups of friends who have been together for over 10 years will get 30% off, that's such a good deal. The steak is very delicious, the sauce is rich, served with well cooked vegetables, only the chicken wings are a bit crumbly but that's okay.\nI'll definitely come back for the pasta next time.\nRead more\nWritten October 27, 2023",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
